      <div class="p-6">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Notification Branding & Trust Seals</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">Configure business identity, clinic stamps, and DPO verification footer for outbound notices.</p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/40 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1">Entity Brand Name</label>
